  "body": "Tucked away in one of Milford’s most prestigious and tightly held avenues, this two-level townhouse offers an unbeatable lakeside lifestyle. \r\n\r\nSmartly designed to maximise space with a bedroom and bathroom on each level, ideal for flexible living arrangements, guests, or flatmates. The lower level also includes a study area.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is light-filled with open plan kitchen, dining and lounge which flow to a small deck with partial views of Lake Pupuke.\r\n\r\nThere is a single carport complete with built-in storage cupboards to easily tuck away your sports gear, tools or beach essentials.\r\n\r\nLeave the car at home as there are numerous options for bus transport to surrounding suburbs or Auckland CBD. Enjoy an easy walk to the vibrant Milford Village, local cafes, shops, Lake Pupuke and Milford beach.\r\n\r\nZoned for Milford Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate School, Westlake Boys & Girls High Schools plus Takapuna Grammar.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to secure a foothold into a ‘blue chip’ suburb, downsize or invest in a high demand location, this is an affordable option – Don’t miss this one! Join us at our open homes or call now for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
